OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan completes 24-hour challenge to
OL,4,Aflip 100kg tyre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Surrey says he has completed
OL,7,Fa "brutal" challenge of flipping over a
OL,8,F100kg (16st) tractor tyre non-stop for
OL,9,F24 hours.
OL,11,FJames Farmer says he beat the current
OL,12,Frecord of flipping the trye for 11.21km
OL,13,F(6.96 miles) with a 13km effort at Glyn
OL,14,FSchool in Epsom, where he is helping to
OL,15,Fraise funds for a new sports pavilion.
OL,17,FStarting at midday on Sunday, the
OL,18,Fformer pupil-turned-fitness instructor
OL,19,Fcontinued through the night into Monday
OL,20,Fmorning, doing laps around a marked
OL,21,F100m track.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
