OL,3,GNEWSAMan completes 24-hour challenge to
OL,4,Aflip 100kg tyre
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm happy I've done it, but my hands
OL,7,Fare killing me and my forearms feel
OL,8,Flike they're going to burst," said the
OL,9,F43-year-old, who is now waiting for
OL,10,Fverification from Guinness World
OL,11,FRecords.
